Package: xpn-client
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, python3, iproute2, nftables,
 systemd-resolved, ca-certificates
Recommends: zbar-tools
Description: XPN native TLS/WebSocket VPN client
 Native C client with Python enrollment and routing launcher, QR camera
 enrollment, pinned server certificates, and full or split IPv4 tunneling.

Package: xpn-server
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, nodejs (>= 24.13.1),
 adduser, iproute2, nftables, procps, ca-certificates, python3, curl, openssl, nginx
Description: XPN native VPN server and Node administration service
 Native C packet service and Node administration, encrypted QR enrollment,
 certificate policy and optional SMTP invitations. Run xpn-server-setup to
 configure nginx and services. Installation alone does not enable or start
 services.
